+`conversation.input.after` is a session-scoped list after the composer bar and receives the same `InputZone` owner as `conversation.input.dock`. `conversation.input.inside` is a session-scoped list after attachments and to the left of the draft editor; its owner supplies the current `session` snapshot (undefined while unavailable), and it does not replace the existing `accessory` prop. Fixed overlays must portal to the document body.
